  "html": "<p>🚨 <strong>Jersey Smooth Popup Event</strong> 🚨<br><strong>When</strong>: <strong>3/7</strong> from <strong>4-6pm</strong><br><strong>Where</strong>: Highway 90 Dispensary, Marlton NJ</p><p><img data-ref=\"https://www.thehighway90.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/jersey-smooth-logo-2-2048x643.png\" alt=\"Jersey smooth vapes available now at highway 90 dispensary in marlton, nj\"></p><p>Join us for an exclusive <a href=\"/brands/jersey-smooth/\"><strong>Jersey Smooth</strong></a> event at Highway 90 Dispensary! Dive into the science and artistry behind New Jersey’s leading cannabis brand, known for its exceptional products and smooth, flavorful experiences. 🌿</p><p><strong>Discover Jersey Smooth’s Premium Vapes:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Full Service Gas</strong>: A tribute to the iconic Sour Diesel, featuring sharp, tangy notes and a robust, energizing experience. Perfect for creativity and daytime focus. 🚗💨</li><li><strong>Boardwalk Bliss</strong>: A delightful blend of Strawberry Cheesecake and Sherbert Cookies, delivering euphoric relaxation and sweet, creamy flavors. 🍓🍪</li><li><strong>HighBush Blueberry</strong>: A hybrid mix of blueberry and raspberry with sweet, skunky undertones. Perfect for balanced focus and relaxation. 💙🍇</li></ul><p><strong>Jersey Smooth Vapes</strong> come in 0.5g &amp; 1g carts and 1g &amp; 2g disposables. Whether you’re a connoisseur or a casual user, you’ll find something to fuel your senses.</p><p><strong>Don’t miss out!</strong> Meet the Jersey Smooth team, learn more about their family-owned, community-rooted business, and explore their line of smooth, flavorful products. 💨✨</p><p><a href=\"/brands/jersey-smooth/\">Shop Jersey Smooth Now!</a></p>",
